    "summary": "In this conversation, a user expressing profound existential hopelessness and the feeling of being \"fundamentally broken\" is met by an AI assistant. The user suggests that pushing through life is \"torture\" and that some people are beyond repair. The assistant responds with empathetic validation and suggests shifting focus toward \"rest\" and \"letting go of the need to fix.\"",
